	"descriptionMarkdown": "Reliable Transport Vessel for the inner planets <br>\nSelf-sufficient <br>\nEnergy-efficient <br>\nControllable Thrust for Fuel Saving <br><br>\n\n\nMalakai Enterprises presents our newest creation, the Starter Ship™!\n\nThis ship is designed to help fresh Space Explorers to make their first steps into the Solar System! It's not the cheapest ship one can start with, but it's clearly the most reliable one! It has everything one could ask for when facing the hardships of Space Travel for the first time. It is fully self-sufficient in terms of energy and ammunition production and has a decent cargo bay for all the early needs of a true Space Explorer.\nIt uses only Efficiency Modules Tier 1 and no advanced processing technologies.\n\nAlso we added a switch at the rear of the ship for throttle control. When the Constant Combinator is turned on it lowers fuel flow. This speeds down the ship but saves a lot of fuel due to higher burning efficiency. An orange light indicates if the Fuel Saving Mode is turned on. \n\nWe suggest to kickstart the ship with a good load of ice at the beginning to fill its water tanks for fuel production. Once on board it gets automatically smelted into water.\n\nThat's it for now, we hope you enjoy our creation and wish you Happy Exploring!\n\n",
